  <PM_B12Vanguard_12GaugeDragonsBreath.label>12 口径龙息弹</PM_B12Vanguard_12GaugeDragonsBreath.label>
  <PM_B12Vanguard_12GaugeDragonsBreath.labelShort>12 号龙息</PM_B12Vanguard_12GaugeDragonsBreath.labelShort>
  <PM_B12Vanguard_12GaugeDragonsBreath.description>12口径液态龙息是一种液体弹丸，它在短距离锥形区域内散布燃烧弹丸，引燃沾上的任何理论可燃的物体。剧烈的烧蚀会破坏目标对高温的耐受性。</PM_B12Vanguard_12GaugeDragonsBreath.description>

